        "quiz_id": 3531,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Large companies use sports events to promote their products. Some people think this has a negative impact on sports. To what extent do you agree or disagree?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NzehdOu3eoA6WoxBUaYlNJNwgQb\"><strong>Large companies use sports events to promote their products. Some people think this has a negative impact on sports. To what extent do you agree or disagree?</strong></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Sports Event Sponsorship&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZXCTdIwYfoEHiYxN02ilInbigxc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Sports Event Sponsorship&nbsp;cho 1 quan điểm:</strong> C&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn sử dụng c&aacute;c sự kiện thể thao để quảng b&aacute; sản phẩm của họ. Một số người nghĩ rằng điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đến thể thao.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E3ZGdHNbvo7a5Xx13JCl7W0YgIf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Bạn đồng &yacute; hay kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với &yacute; kiến n&agrave;y?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G2WQdS3ZBo0EqjxQ0E6lWFRcgag\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Sports Event Sponsorship&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F528dFEjBo6SNZxoRhwltZTugjE\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HmfndoSPQowoGTxD5NxlDXDHg8e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mn9bdR5NqoPxjfxpiRdlL4L3gXg\"><em>(*) Bạn học&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-to-what-extent\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">c&aacute;ch viết Introduction cho dạng To what extent </span></a></strong>ở đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;.</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KZH7dfmkgoHhTWxRag7lCbaHgPf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WxkxdSg0moGTKxxQC9ClmVX7gIe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>make use of STH <em>(sử dụng, tận dụng c&aacute;i g&igrave; đ&oacute;)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P0XodrcrvoRQ5BxqaQgl94KYgK1\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>corporate sponsorship <em>(t&agrave;i trợ đến từ doanh nghiệp)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">Bạn n&ecirc;n n&oacute;i r&otilde; quan điểm của m&igrave;nh l&agrave; đồng &yacute;, hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm của đề. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm '<strong>kh&ocirc;ng</strong> <strong>đồng &yacute;'</strong>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng \"<strong>mặc d&ugrave; t&agrave;i trợ đến từ doanh nghiệp cho c&aacute;c sự kiện thể thao mang lại một số t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đến thể thao, nhưng những lợi &iacute;ch m&agrave; n&oacute; mang lại sẽ đ&aacute;ng kể hơn\"</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MvJpdBfVJoVwjCxvq9qlilBMged\"><em>(*) Bạn t&igrave;m hiểu về bản chất của <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> ở b&agrave;i học thử n&agrave;y nh&eacute;: <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cach-lap-luan-4060\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic lập luận dạng 'To What Extent'</a></strong></span></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8hBdo0PeoqsShxLrO2lVfjLggg\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận Partly Agree</strong> th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DJ7UdTfc8oo2WyxIphSljunsgDe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về một số vấn đề nhỏ m&agrave; việc t&agrave;i trợ đến từ doanh nghiệp cho c&aacute;c sự kiện thể thao g&acirc;y ra.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vt2udEiR3otV1NxclTqllVpUgDc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng sự t&agrave;i trợ n&agrave;y mang lại những lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>B&agrave;n về một số vấn đề nhỏ m&agrave; việc t&agrave;i trợ đến từ doanh nghiệp cho c&aacute;c sự kiện thể thao g&acirc;y ra</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, việc thương mại h&oacute;a c&aacute;c sự kiện thể thao c&oacute; những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực nhất định</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PpnQdgecGorUQ9xqsaulsoDkgNh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SSJRdsOQtoG7mJxddeXldVAIgyc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: <em>Tinh thần thuần t&uacute;y (pure spirit)</em> của thể thao dường như đang <em>giảm dần (diminishing)</em> khi c&aacute;c cuộc thi thể thao ng&agrave;y c&agrave;ng biến th&agrave;nh <em>c&aacute;c dự &aacute;n kinh doanh (business ventures)</em> thay v&igrave; những sự kiện văn h&oacute;a.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-INZedPXZIoDxdVx6GXIl6kCYgQb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>Thế vận hội Olympic, từng được t&ocirc;n vinh chủ yếu v&igrave; <em>c&aacute;c m&agrave;n tr&igrave;nh diễn xuất sắc trong thể thao (excellent athletic performances)</em>, giờ đ&acirc;y đầy rẫy <em>những đoạn quảng c&aacute;o (commerical breaks)</em> v&agrave; <em>logo nh&agrave; t&agrave;i trợ (sponsor logos)</em>, l&agrave;m chuyển hướng sự ch&uacute; &yacute; từ th&agrave;nh t&iacute;ch thể thao sang cơ hội tiếp thị.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JSD9dGbNiorQORx8xSwlhZVLg5b\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YQygdQYwUom7iexF14hlO2dkgDd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Ngo&agrave;i ra, quảng c&aacute;o qu&aacute; mức c&oacute; thể l&agrave;m <em>ph&acirc;n t&acirc;m (distract)</em> người xem, khiến họ kh&ocirc;ng thể tận hưởng trọn vẹn c&aacute;c sự kiện thể thao.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X4mDdsOcXoolKVx1QFjl4Ir2gyc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> C&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty thường tranh nhau sự ch&uacute; &yacute; với <em>những quảng c&aacute;o bắt mắt (flashy advertisements)</em> trong những khoảnh khắc quan trọng, như quảng c&aacute;o chia m&agrave;n h&igrave;nh trong c&aacute;c trận đấu b&oacute;ng đ&aacute;, khiến cho kh&aacute;n giả kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; những trải nghiệm trong thể thao một c&aacute;ch trọn vẹn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng sự ph&aacute;t triển của m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh v&agrave; điện thoại đ&atilde; mang lợi những lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể cho khả năng đọc viết của giới trẻ.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng t&agrave;i trợ doanh nghiệp mang lại lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể hơn cho thể thao.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SFw6dSGEGoRcSSxYg3glmCgUgac\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WduxdLYRlouMz3x9cZYlxJxAgje\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>tiền t&agrave;i trợ gi&uacute;p ph&aacute;t triển cơ sở vật chất v&agrave; trang thiết bị tốt hơn cho c&aacute;c vận động vi&ecirc;n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NwBjdg29WoaKIDxNhPGl7MGpgbd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example: </strong>C&aacute;c nh&agrave; t&agrave;i trợ lớn như Nike v&agrave; Adidas <em>cung cấp nguồn lực t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh (provide financial resources)</em> cho <em>c&aacute;c trung t&acirc;m đ&agrave;o tạo hiện đại (state-of-the-art training centers)</em> v&agrave; <em>thiết bị ti&ecirc;n tiến (advanced equipment)</em>, gi&uacute;p c&aacute;c vận động vi&ecirc;n n&acirc;ng cao hiệu suất th&ocirc;ng qua c&ocirc;ng nghệ v&agrave; m&ocirc;i trường được cải thiện</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SfNydu4h7oYzAYx4ZyVl57ZBgKf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2: </strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YLs1dL1D7o7jbHxj8NElcItIgOB\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> nguồn t&agrave;i trợ tăng l&ecirc;n dẫn đến mức lương cao hơn, <em>thu h&uacute;t c&aacute;c đấu thủ t&agrave;i năng v&agrave;o thể thao chuy&ecirc;n nghiệp (attract talented competitors to professional sports)</em>, v&igrave; <em>sự đảm bảo về mặt t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh (financial security)</em> cho ph&eacute;p c&aacute;c vận động vi&ecirc;n<em> tập trung ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n (focus exclusively)</em> v&agrave;o việc luyện tập m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng phải lo lắng về <em>việc trang trải cuộc sống (making ends meet)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWgmdHBiaoCL70xLVzHlqO01gYg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Example:</strong> V&iacute; dụ, c&aacute;c cầu thủ b&oacute;ng đ&aacute; h&agrave;ng đầu hiện c&oacute; thể kiếm đủ tiền để <em>duy tr&igrave; phong độ đỉnh cao (maintain peak performance)</em> quanh năm, điều n&agrave;y cuối c&ugrave;ng <em>n&acirc;ng cao ti&ecirc;u chuẩn (raise the standard)</em> của c&aacute;c cuộc thi khi nhiều c&aacute; nh&acirc;n t&agrave;i năng chọn thể thao l&agrave;m sự nghiệp của họ.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MBiidSgyBoGG3yxZF4Bl60qlg2f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TcZnd99dmoDoeqx1VbLlL8Lhgve\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>corporate involvement in sports <em>(sự nh&uacute;ng tay v&agrave;o thể thao của c&aacute;c doanh nghiệp)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EM9DdKyD2owxPOxc09TlQvgRgnf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">financial support from large companies <em>(hỗ trợ t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh từ c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 869,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Drrsd2SV6owryaxYw5nltfaDgbf\">Large companies make use of sports events to promote their products. While some people believe this has a negative impact on sports, I believe that the advantages of corporate sponsorship outweigh the disadvantages.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14853,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 870,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MSMSd98lQojB9axeIVwl9JGxgQe\"><strong>Admittedly, the commercialization of sports events has certain negative effects.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">The pure spirit of sports seems to be diminishing as sporting competitions increasingly transform into business ventures rather than cultural events. For example, the Olympic Games, once celebrated primarily for athletic excellence, are now filled with commercial breaks and sponsor logos, shifting focus from athletic achievement to marketing opportunities.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, excessive advertising can distract viewers from fully enjoying sports events. Companies often compete for attention with flashy advertisements during key moments, such as split-screen ads during football matches, preventing spectators from fully engaging with the sporting experience.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14853,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 871,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PZTVdZfploZ3D4xKUHxl9N8ggTb\"><strong>However, I believe corporate sponsorship brings more significant benefits to sports.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Firstly, sponsorship money enables the development of better facilities and equipment for athletes. Major sponsors like Nike and Adidas provide financial resources for state-of-the-art training centers and advanced equipment, helping athletes enhance their performance through improved technology and environments.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Secondly, the increased funding results in higher salaries that attract talented competitors to professional sports. Financial security allows athletes to focus exclusively on training without worrying about making ends meet. For instance, top footballers can now earn enough to maintain peak performance year-round, which ultimately raises the standard of competitions as more talented individuals choose sports as their career.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14853,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 872,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZBQkdUW3AoLO3qxELq3lsE1igEb\">In conclusion, while corporate involvement in sports does have some negative consequences, I believe the financial support from large companies ultimately benefits the sporting world more significantly. The improved facilities, equipment, and financial security for athletes contribute to higher standards of performance and competition.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14853,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
